{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>mappy 是一款專注於 Mac 的心智圖與筆記應用，適合需要整理思緒、學習、規劃與腦力激盪的人使用。使用者可用鍵盤快速建立分支，為每個節點加入整頁筆記，並將每張地圖以 .mindmap 檔案存放在自選資料夾。原價 US $20.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>鍵盤建圖與節點筆記</h2>\n<p>mappy 以鍵盤為核心，按 Tab 新增子節點、Enter 新增同層節點。每個節點均可展開成整頁筆記，支援清單、待辦清單、引言、程式碼區塊、圖片與 LaTeX 公式。地圖可逐個節點演示，亦可匯出含節點筆記的可選文字 PDF。應用支援自動儲存與版本備份，沒有帳戶、廣告或訂閱。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2880x1800bb-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2880x1800bb-1-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2880x1800bb-2-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2880x1800bb-3-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2880x1800bb-4-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2880x1800bb-5-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：mappy</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T10:39:02.949426+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":318,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T10:20:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T20:17:39.915103+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-12T10:37:38.876150+00:00","content_hash":"19023dcb2f4683091b3457db535451e3a9f8f98e28fe12c3389fcdd41302051b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}